      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "Agreeing with the judge, and not for the fixture gap. The Wilkin call returned fixture_not_found and never executed, yet the skill went on to write log_003 as though a search had happened. A tool error is not evidence of absence. The fixture gap exposed this, but stocking a fixture would not fix it — the skill would still be treating a failed call as a nil result, and production tools error too."
